  "id": "fakeout-misread-01",
  "title": {
    "en": "Mistaking a Pullback for a Fake Breakout",
    "bn": "Pullback-কে fake breakout ভেবে ভুল"
  },
  "bias": "bearish",
  "outcome": "loss",
  "tags": [
    "fake-breakout",
    "misread",
    "retest"
  ],
  "caption": {
    "en": "Candle 18 is a strong real breakout. Candle 19 dips but closes at 1.0912, still above 1.0900. A sell at 1.0910 is hit by candle 20 and stopped out at 1.0946.",
    "bn": "১৮ নম্বর candle জোরালো প্রকৃত breakout। ১৯ নম্বর candle নামে, কিন্তু 1.0912-এ close করে, 1.0900-এর ওপরেই। 1.0910-এ sell করলে ২০ নম্বর candle stop 1.0946 কাটে।"
  },
